    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5b105250fc@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Orthopaedics, the Official Joint Replacement Products of the PGA TOUR® and PGA TOUR Champions, announced plans to activate on-site at the Travelers Championship in Cromwell, CT. This weekend marks the sixth tournament of the year where Stryker will engage with consumers and bring The Mobility Zone – a destination designed to educate golf fans on the importance of joint health and mobility – on site. In addition, on Friday of tournament week, Stryker will make its fourth K9s for Warriors donation of 2017 in an effort to honor the company’s ongoing commitment to our nation’s military.</p>\n<p><b><a href=\"http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/stryker-to-make-its-fourth-k9s-for-warriors-donation-of-2017-at-travelers-championship-300477091.html\">Please click here for the full article.</a></b></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
